{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review school classifications and consider SEND and alternative categories",
        "additional_details": "We believe existing school classifications fail to truly reflect our educational system. We call for a review of these classifications and consideration of two additional categories:\r\n \r\n- Senstream: For schools offering standard, mainstream qualifications alongside intensive, specialist support.\r\n \r\n- Alternative: For schools using non-traditional philosophies or short-term transitional support like PRUs.\r\n \r\nWe believe the current system limits parental choice, strains current resources  and complicates funding. Reforming these categories could help ensure every child thrives.\r\n",
        "background": "We ask the Department for Education to review existing school classifications and consider introducing additional 'Senstream' and 'Alternative' categories to better reflect the range of educational provision available.",
